{title: 229 - All Hail the Power of Jesus' Name}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #229 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 229}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]All [F]hail the power [Dm/A]of [Gm/Bb]Jesus' name! [Dm/A]Let [C7/Bb]angels [Gm]prostrate fall;
[Am]Bring [C7]forth the royal [F/C]diadem, [C/G]and [Dm/A]crown [G]Him [C/G]Lord [Am]of all.
[F/C]Bring [C7]forth the [Gm]royal diadem, [C]and [Gm/D]crown [F/C]Him [C7]Lord of all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Ye [F]chosen seed [Gm/Bb]of [Dm/A]Israel's [Gm/Bb]race, [Dm/A]ye [F/C]ransomed [Gm]from [Am]the [Gm]fall,
[Am]Hail [C7]Him who saves [F/C]you [C]by [Am]His [Dm/A]grace, [C/G]and [G]crown [C/G]Him [F]Lord [Am]of all.
[F/C]Hail Him [C7]who saves [Gm]you by [Dm/A]His [C]grace, [Gm/D]and [F/C]crown [C7]Him Lord of [Dm/A]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Let [F]every kindred, [Dm/A]every [Gm/Bb]tribe [Dm/A]on [C7/Bb]this [Dm/A]terrestrial [Gm]ball
[Am]To [C7]Him all majesty [Am]ascribe, [Dm/A]and [C/G]crown Him [F]Lord [Am]of all.
[F/C]To [C7]Him all [Gm]majesty [Dm/A]ascribe, [Gm/D]and [F/C]crown [C7]Him Lord of [Dm/A]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]O [F]that with yonder [Dm/A]angel [Gm/Bb]throng [Dm/A]we [F/C]at [C7/Bb]His [Gm]feet [Am]may [Gm]fall!
[Am]We'll [C7]join the everlasting [C/G]song, [Dm/A]and [C/G]crown Him [F]Lord [Am]of all.
[F/C]We'll [C7]join the [Gm]everlasting [C]song, [Gm/D]and [F/C]crown [C7]Him Lord of [Dm/A]all.
{end_of_verse}
